    "mapping_notes": "# vllm__scaled_mm_blockwise_sm100_fp8__sm_100f\n\n## Reference interface\n\nAll indices below are logical indices. Byte-level layout information from the\nsaved optimized input is retained in interface.json.\n\n| Parameter | Type | Logical shape | Role | Optimized counterpart |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| A | e4m3 | 64 x 256 | input | logical activation A |\n| B | e4m3 | 128 x 256 | input | logical weight B; reference rows are output channels |\n| D | bf16 | 64 x 128 | output | D |\n| scale_a | float | 64 x 2 | input | scale_a |\n| scale_b | float | 1 x 2 | input | scale_b |\n\n## Computation and mapping\n\nThe reference uses A[m,k], B[n,k], and D[m,n]; B is stored with output-channel first.\nFor each 128-element K block kb, accumulate its dot product, then multiply\nby scale_a[m/1,kb] * scale_b[n/128,kb] and add to D.\nScale arrays are exposed with axes [row-group,K-group]. Reindex the\noptimized scale layouts using the corresponding source layout/stride fields.\nOptimized A element offset: m*K + k.\nOptimized B element offset: n*K + k.\nOptimized D element offset: m*N + n.\nReferences always store D at m*N+n; compare logical elements after this reindexing.\nThe saved epilogue uses alpha=1 and beta=0; C is not read.\n\n## Validation boundary\n\nCompiled to PTX and numerically checked on CPU. Not compared against an optimized\nGPU execution or proven equivalent. Precision/reduction-order differences follow\nthe mathematical contract in the top-level README.\n\n## Upstream\n\n- https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/blob/605c3ddcbaaee06a2687a961ae7be51aec5dddc0/csrc/libtorch_stable/quantization/w8a8/cutlass/c3x/scaled_mm_blockwise_sm100_fp8.cu\n- https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass/blob/cb4247394dd82148787aed73e5dc7cef33cbf862/include/cutlass/device_kernel.h\n- https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass/blob/cb4247394dd82148787aed73e5dc7cef33cbf862/include/cutlass/arch/arch.h\n- https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass/blob/cb4247394dd82148787aed73e5dc7cef33cbf862/include/cutlass/gemm/kernel/sm100_gemm_tma_warpspecialized.hpp\n"
